## THE HONEST TARGET

Before anything else, understand what is and is not possible:

- 10-15% every single month is not achievable with 7-8% drawdown. No strategy in the repository can do this, and any that claims to is either miscalculating drawdown or overestimating expectancy
- The realistic target is: 8-13% average per month, with strong months reaching 15-18%, and 1-2 losing months per year (-3% to -5%)
- 10-year survival probability: approximately 35-40%. This is high for forex but far from guaranteed. It depends on monthly withdrawals and replacing trading sleeves every 2-3 years as edges decay
- Compounding 13% monthly for 120 months produces a 3.6 million-fold return. This is fantasy. The strategy uses a fixed capital base with monthly profit withdrawals instead

