## 4. SLEEVE C: ASIAN-SESSION MEAN REVERSION

This sleeve provides the low-beta, high-hit-rate anchor that keeps the portfolio producing even in dead markets.

### 4.1 Trading Window

00:00-06:30 UK time, on AUDNZD, EURGBP, EURCHF only.

### 4.2 Entry Conditions (All must pass)

1. H1 ADX(14) is below 16. This sleeve only trades in genuinely range-bound markets
2. Price touches the upper or lower 2.0-standard-deviation Bollinger Band (20-period)
3. The touch candle has a wick of at least 50% of its range (rejection)
4. RSI(14) on M15 is above 70 (for shorts) or below 30 (for longs)
5. Enter on a limit order at the Bollinger Band level
6. Stop loss: 1.0 x ATR(M15, 14) beyond the touch candle's extreme
7. Target: the 20-period moving average (middle Bollinger Band)

### 4.3 Exit

| Trigger | Action |
|---|---|
| Price reaches 20-period MA | Close 100% at market |
| 06:30 UK | Hard flat everything. No exceptions |
| Stop hit | Close at market |
| Friday 20:00 UK | Flat everything |

No partial exits, no trailing. This is a simple fade with a single target.

### 4.4 Scoring

Minimum 4/5 to trade:

| # | Filter | Pass Condition |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Regime | H1 ADX(14) below 16 |
| 2 | Bollinger touch | Price touches 2.0 sigma band |
| 3 | Rejection wick | Touch candle wick at least 50% of range |
| 4 | RSI extreme | M15 RSI above 70 or below 30 |
| 5 | Spread | At most 1.5x average |

Score 5/5: full tier (0.24%). Score 4/5: half tier (0.12%). Below 4: no trade.

### 4.5 Expected Trade Count

Approximately 70 trades per month.

