## 9. PARAMETER DISCIPLINE

- Freeze all parameters after walk-forward validation
- Re-validate quarterly, never re-optimize monthly
- Every parameter must be defended by a plateau in the results surface, not a spike. A parameter that only works at one exact value is curve-fitting. Delete it.
- Maximum 4 tunable parameters per sleeve, forever
- When you replace a sleeve every 2-3 years, the new sleeve goes through all 6 gates from scratch

